  "caption_en": "RTKLIB moving-base heading errors and output times during nominal walking, large body motion and single-antenna obstruction. Original, Alt. eph., Multi-GNSS and Fix-and-hold denote the original configuration, modified ephemeris, extended constellation selection and fix-and-hold processing, respectively. The upper row shows errors of newly available fixed solutions; the middle row shows errors when the latest heading is held between updates; the lower row marks new-output times.",
  "caption_zh": "常规行走、大幅机身运动和单侧天线遮挡实验中，RTKLIB动基线航向误差与输出时间。四种配置依次为原始配置、修改星历、扩展星座选择和fix-and-hold处理。上排为新固定解的误差，中排为相邻更新之间保持最近一次航向时的误差，下排标出新解出现的时刻。",
  "meaning_zh": "将“有一个航向值”与“此刻有新的有效航向解”分开，让长时间保持旧值的误差和稀疏新解都能直接看见。",
